    <!-- ============ SECTION 14 – GLOSSARY ============ -->
    <div class="section-header" id="s14"><span class="num">14</span><h2>Quick-Reference Glossary</h2><span class="line"></span></div>
    <div class="three-col">
      <div class="card cn">
        <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Segment</div><div class="glossary-def">A distinguishable activity or group of activities for which separate financial information is appropriate for performance evaluation and resource-allocation decisions.</div></div>
        <div class="glossary-item" style="border-bottom:none;"><div class="glossary-term">Service segment</div><div class="glossary-def">A distinguishable component providing related outputs or achieving particular operating objectives consistent with the entity's mission.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card cn">
        <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Geographical segment</div><div class="glossary-def">A distinguishable component providing outputs or achieving operating objectives within a particular geographical area.</div></div>
        <div class="glossary-item" style="border-bottom:none;"><div class="glossary-term">Segment accounting policies</div><div class="glossary-def">Policies adopted for the consolidated/entity statements, plus policies specific to segment reporting (e.g. inter-segment transfer pricing).</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card cn">
        <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Segment assets / liabilities</div><div class="glossary-def">Operating assets/liabilities directly attributable to, or reasonably allocable to, a segment's activities.</div></div>
        <div class="glossary-item" style="border-bottom:none;"><div class="glossary-term">Segment revenue / expense</div><div class="glossary-def">Revenue/expense directly attributable or reasonably allocable to a segment, including inter-segment amounts.</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

